  "description": "Fantasy-themed modernized Pacman.",
  "long_description": "This game is intended to be kind of casual. Playing a level should be a challenge if you have 10-15 minutes to waste on your lunch-break. This game is meant to be a modernized version of the arcade classic Pacman with a slight touch of epic fantasy. The game principle is quite simple: collect all the treasures in the labyrinth level and unlock the exit before the time runs out.\nFor the first time you can fight back and hit enemies pressing X.\n\nNote: this download is hosted on an external server, not GitHub, and may stop working if that server goes down or changes without the catalog knowing.",
